<%# The read-only twin of this page, named so a reader who wanted the audit does
    not record paperwork to find out. Named either way, but linked only when the
    link would open rather than bounce the reader to the dashboard: this page
    admits Vehicle Management, and the audit does not. %>
<%= ui_callout_box :info, icon: "circle-info", icon_type: :solid do %>
  <strong>This records paperwork; it does not check it.</strong>
  <% if has_role?([Role::EVENT_MANAGEMENT, Role::VEHICLE_INFO_UPDATE]) %>
    To see who is still missing a signature, use
    <%= link_to "Vehicle Paperwork", vehicles_paperwork_path %>.
  <% else %>
    Who is still missing a signature is on the Vehicle Paperwork page, which needs
    the Event Management or Vehicle Info Update role.
  <% end %>
<% end %>
